      "problem": "Suppose $|\\,c\\,|=6\\sqrt{3}$ and the angle between vectors $c$ and $d$ is $\\theta ={30}^{∘}.$ Find the scalar projection of $c$ onto $d.$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the formula for the scalar projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{d}\\,c & =|\\,c\\,|\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =6\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({30}^{∘}) \\\\  & =6\\sqrt{3}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\\\  & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
